cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ANIMA, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "ANIMA – AI Navigator for Informed Mental Health Applications"
abstract: >-
  An open European framework for AI in psychology and mental health. ANIMA
  brings together WHO global and WHO Europe recommendations, EU law and
  national law (starting with Austria) along three axes: regulatory layer,
  usage context and spectrum from wellbeing to diagnostics and treatment.
type: dataset
authors:
